source_en:
If A = [3, 4, 5} and B = {4, 5, 7} , then - 
 i. A \cup B = {3, 4, 5, 7}
 ii.A \cap B = {4, 5}
 iii. A \subset B
 Which one is correct?

translation:
যদি A = [3,4,5} এবং B = {4,5,7} হয়, তাহলে -
i। A \cup B = {3,4,5,7}
ii. A \cap B = {4,5}
iii। A \subset B
কোনটা সঠিক?

back_translation:
If A = [3,4,5} and B = {4,5,7}, then
i. A \cup B = {3,4,5, 7}
ii. A \cap B = {4,5}
iii. A \subset B
Which is correct?

translation:
Jab \( k=-3 \) ho, to \(
P=4^{k}
\) ki value kya hai?

back_translation:
When \( k=-3 \) is, what is the value of \(
P=4^{k}
\)?

translation:
In chaar numbers ka median \( 5 \). \(
\begin{array}{cccc}
3&12&1&?
\end{array}
\). Find karo missing number ki value.

back_translation:
The median of these four numbers is \( 5 \). \(
\begin{array}{cccc}
3&12&1&?
\end{array}
\). Find the value of the missing number.

translation:
Ei chaar number-er median holo \( 5 \). \(
\begin{array}{cccc}
3&12&1&?
\end{array}
\) Missing number-er value ber koro.

back_translation:
The median of these four numbers is \( 5 \). \(
\begin{array}{cccc}
3&12&1&?
\end{array}
\) Find the value of the missing number.

translation:
Work out: \(
\frac{4}{11}+\frac{7}{11}
\) Write your answer in its simplest form.

back_translation:
Work out: \(
\frac{4}{11}+\frac{7}{11}
\) Write your answer in its simplest form.
